        },
        {
          "text": "Abarukukurataho, nubo abo abaarugire Terimera, Teriharasa, Kerubu, Addani na Imeeri, noobu baraaba batarasoboire kugumya amaju aga baisenkurubo rundi obwijukuru bwabo, okugumiza kimu nkooku bakaba bali kwo Baisirairi; ",
          "type": "text",
